      "role": "user",
      "content": "got it. so if the salt is just sitting there in the database for anyone to see, does that mean it's not really doing much to stop a hacker who's already compromised the database? like, if they have the hashes and the salts, aren't they still able to run brute force attacks pretty easily?",
